{
  "tema": 6752,
  "slug": "cual-cuales",
  "titulo": "Using cuál / cuáles = which / what (interrogative pronouns)",
  "subtitulo": "¿Cuál es tu carro? Dime cuáles prefieres.",
  "foto": "t10.jpg",
  "regla": "Cuál (singular) / cuáles (plural) = which, which one(s), in direct and indirect questions. Same form for masculine and feminine, always with an accent, never with an article (that's el cual, the relative).",
  "comparada_kwiziq": "2026-10-10",
  "secciones": [
    {
      "id": "regla",
      "titulo": "The rule",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "**Cuál** and **cuáles** ask **which (one / ones)**, choosing from a group, in direct and in indirect questions."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "tabla",
          "encabezados": [
            "",
            "Form"
          ],
          "filas": [
            [
              "singular",
              "cuál"
            ],
            [
              "plural",
              "cuáles"
            ]
          ]
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "No masculine/feminine difference, only singular and plural."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "As a question word it **always** has an accent and **never** takes an article. **El cual / la cual** (with article, no accent) is a relative pronoun, a different thing."
        },
        {
          "tipo": "texto",
          "texto": "Tip: **cuál** is a pointing finger: it picks one from the line-up."
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "directas",
      "titulo": "Direct questions",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "—¿==Cuál== es tu carro? —El blanco.",
              "en": "—Which one is your car? —The white one."
            },
            {
              "es": "—¿==Cuál== es su casa? —La más alta.",
              "en": "—Which one is her house? —The tallest one."
            },
            {
              "es": "En esta tienda hay flores bonitas. ¿==Cuáles== prefieres?",
              "en": "There are pretty flowers in this shop. Which ones do you prefer?"
            },
            {
              "es": "De todos esos cuadros, ¿==cuáles== pintaste tú?",
              "en": "Of all those paintings, which ones did you paint?"
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "indirectas",
      "titulo": "Indirect questions",
      "bloques": [
        {
          "tipo": "ejemplos",
          "lista": [
            {
              "es": "Dime ==cuál== te gusta más.",
              "en": "Tell me which one you like best."
            },
            {
              "es": "Quería saber ==cuáles== eran mis intenciones.",
              "en": "She wanted to know what my intentions were."
            },
            {
              "es": "Pregúntale al doctor ==cuáles== son los efectos secundarios.",
              "en": "Ask the doctor what the side effects are."
            }
          ]
        }
      ]
    },
    {
